;;; norm, the adjoint (by the Riesz representation), the C* identity ||T* T|| = ||T||^2,
;;; orthogonal projections as operators (Prop. 1.53, 1.55), partial isometries (Prop. 2.1,
;;; Cor. 2.4).  F. J. Thayer, "Banach Algebras and Applications", ch. 1 s.7, ch. 2 s.1.
;;; Agent BA-BH, wave 2026-11-09.  Destination: theorem-library/ba-bh.scm.  Library:
;;; operator-algebras.  Helper prefix bbh-.  Every qed bills modulo 0.
;;; Load window: after structure-library/ba-ops-vocab.scm, theorem-library/hilbert-space*,
;;; hilbert-projection.scm (riesz-representation-exists, orthogonal-projection-*), and the
;;; sqrt / square lemmas (sqrt-prop, rr-square-le-imp-le, rr-square-mono); nothing in the
